s://www.instagram.com/shrikepublishing","lucide:instagram",{"title":48,"links":163},[164,165,166],{"platform":130,"url":53,"icon":13},{"platform":56,"url":57,"icon":132},{"platform":59,"url":60,"icon":134},[168],{"title":139,"links":169},[170,171,172,173,174,175],{"label":12,"to":17},{"label":36,"to":37},{"label":40,"to":41},{"label":62,"to":67},{"label":44,"to":45},{"label":74,"to":79},{"title":148,"links":177},[178,179,180],{"platform":151,"url":152,"icon":153},{"platform":155,"url":156,"icon":157},{"platform":159,"url":160,"icon":161},"footer/main","sMJVBtaTsfQ3viD1cLZ8J5WDYDJcZs1N8U-IVzvZ870",{"id":184,"title":185,"available":186,"body":187,"coverImage":355,"currency":356,"date":357,"description":358,"extension":359,"featured":360,"image":361,"manualUrl":53,"meta":362,"navigation":186,"path":363,"playTime":355,"playerCount":355,"price":364,"published":186,"releaseDate":355,"resources":365,"seo":368,"slug":369,"stem":370,"tags":371,"thumbnail":355,"__hash__":377},"games/games/get-in-loser-we-re-going-to-steal-the-kilogram.md","Get in Loser, We're Going to Steal the Kilogram",true,{"type":188,"value":189,"toc":350},"minimark",[190,194,202,213,220,223,231,233,240,242,248,250,257,259,262,264,271,273,275,277,280,282,285,287,294,296,303,305,312,314,317,319,324,326,329,331,334,336,339,347],[191,192,185],"h1",{"id":193},"get-in-loser-were-going-to-steal-the-kilogram",[195,196,197],"p",{},[198,199],"img",{"alt":200,"src":201},"v2LeUW.png","/bafkreiahgxziaisasw5ec2xoi27d2mk5k5s2ye3fk7rjr4vkwpwngumtsi.jpg",[203,204,206],"h2",{"id":205},"an-action-packed-heist-for-all-ages",[207,208,209],"em",{},[210,211,212],"strong",{},"An action-packed heist for all ages!",[195,214,215],{},[207,216,217],{},[210,218,219],{},"The year is 2017.",[221,222],"br",{},[195,224,225,230],{},[207,226,227],{},[210,228,229],{},"The model kilogram is a year away from retirement."," ",[221,232],{},[195,234,235],{},[207,236,237],{},[210,238,239],{},"Now is your time!",[221,241],{},[195,243,244,247],{},[207,245,246],{},"Get In Loser, We're Stealing the Kilogram"," takes place during the World Middle School Science Fair, with the eponymous model kilogram as its centerpiece. This game tells two stories: ",[221,249],{},[195,251,252,253,256],{},"The dashing ",[210,254,255],{},"Illustrious Aces",", a heist crew preparing for their final big score, but there's a hitch. Your wheelman ghosted you the day of the job. You have the training, but you'll have to make do with gadgets scrounged from the middle school science fair. ",[221,258],{},[195,260,261],{},"OR",[221,263],{},[195,265,266,267,270],{},"The plucky ",[210,268,269],{},"Grape Juice Gang",", a well-bonded set of middle schoolers who just found a bag of spy gear. Summer break is coming up, and wouldn't nabbing that cool kilogram be a great way to send yourselves off?",[221,272],{},[195,274,261],{},[221,276],{},[195,278,279],{},"Play the two teams against each other in an epic and wacky adventure. ",[221,281],{},[195,283,284],{},"But be careful! ",[221,286],{},[195,288,289,290,293],{},"Whichever run you choose, ",[210,291,292],{},"Junior Detective Jenny Venetti"," is on the case, and she's hot on your trail!",[221,295],{},[195,297,298],{},[207,299,300],{},[210,301,302],{},"Two Teams,",[221,304],{},[195,306,307,230],{},[207,308,309],{},[210,310,311],{},"One Prize.",[221,313],{},[195,315,316],{},"Can you nab the kilogram and get out before Detective Jenny and the authorities close in? ",[221,318],{},[195,320,321,323],{},[207,322,246],{}," is a oneshot heist ttrpg designed to be played in one of 3 possible runs, as described above. The dice mechanic is simple but intuitive. You want to hit the center of your dice's range (so a 5 and a 6 on a d10). The GJG gets more dice to represent their chaos, but the IA gets better but less dice to represent the focus of their training. Skills and gear vary thematically between the overgeared adolescents and the improvising professionals.",[221,325],{},[195,327,328],{},"Build a heister quickly, and run the entire thing in a couple of hours! Great for parties!",[221,330],{},[195,332,333],{},"Your purchase includes the A5 sized singles and spreads for the document at print quality. 8 Pages, in color. ",[221,335],{},[195,337,338],{},"A collaboration between Shrike Publishing and Rathayibacter. ",[195,340,341],{},[342,343,344],"a",{"href":344,"rel":345},"https://shrikepublishing.itch.io/get-in-loser-were-stealing-the-kilogram",[346],"nofollow",[348,349],"hr",{},{"title":351,"searchDepth":352,"depth":352,"links":353},"",2,[354],{"id":205,"depth":352,"text":212},null,"USD","2024-11-10T00:00:00.000Z","A chaotic heist game about stealing the international prototype kilogram from a climate-controlled vault in Paris. For 2-5 players who believe measurement should belong to everyone.","md",false,"/ShrikeLogoNov2021.png",{},"/games/get-in-loser-we-re-going-to-steal-the-kilogram",15,[366],{"title":367,"url":53},"Print & Play Version",{"title":185,"description":358},"steal-the-kilogram","games/get-in-loser-we-re-going-to-steal-the-kilogram",[372,373,374,375,376],"tabletop","heist","comedy","one-shot","print-and-play","YmcZelmPA1Sar_76QyK5iYefhC_x1SJph4AhH4SByog",[],[380,502,637],{"id":381,"title":24,"available":186,"body":382,"coverImage":355,"currency":356,"date":485,"description":486,"extension":359,"featured":186,"image":487,"manualUrl":355,"meta":488,"navigation":186,"path":25,"playTime":355,"playerCount":355,"price":489,"published":186,"releaseDate":355,"resources":490,"seo":495,"slug":386,"stem":496,"tags":497,"thumbnail":355,"__hash__":501},"games/games/blood-neon.md",{"type":188,"value":383,"toc":478},[384,387,391,397,401,429,433,450,454,457,462,466,475],[191,385,24],{"id":386},"blood-neon",[203,388,390],{"id":389},"overview","Overview",[195,392,393,394,396],{},"Welcome to Neo-Tokyo, where corporations rule and hackers fight back. ",[207,395,24],{}," is a cooperative tabletop RPG where players take on the roles of elite hackers navigating the dangerous underworld of a cyberpunk metropolis.",[203,398,400],{"id":399},"game-features","Game Features",[402,403,404,411,417,423],"ul",{},[405,406,407,410],"li",{},[210,408,409],{},"Cooperative Play",": Work together to complete missions and uncover conspiracies",[405,412,413,416],{},[210,414,415],{},"Character Customization",": Create unique hacker characters with cybernetic enhancements",[405,418,419,422],{},[210,420,421],{},"Dynamic Storytelling",": Branching narratives based on player choices",[405,424,425,428],{},[210,426,427],{},"Miniature Components",": Detailed miniatures and terrain pieces",[203,430,432],{"id":431},"whats-included","What's Included",[402,434,435,438,441,444,447],{},[405,436,437],{},"Core rulebook with complete campaign",[405,439,440],{},"Character sheets and customization options",[405,442,443],{},"28mm scale miniatures (4 player characters, various NPCs)",[405,445,446],{},"Modular city terrain tiles",[405,448,449],{},"Dice set and tokens",[203,451,453],{"id":452},"purchase-options","Purchase Options",[195,455,456],{},"Available now on our store for $24.99 USD plus shipping.",[195,458,459],{},[342,460,461],{"href":87},"Buy Now",[203,463,465],{"id":464},"license-community-engagement","License & Community Engagement",[195,467,468,470,471,474],{},[207,469,24],{}," core rules are available under a ",[210,472,473],{},"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC BY-SA 4.0)"," license. This means you can hack it, remix it, create your own campaigns, and share them with the community - just give us credit and share your work under the same license.",[195,476,477],{},"Join our Discord community to share your Blood Neon campaigns and get tips from other players!",{"title":351,"searchDepth":352,"depth":352,"links":479},[480,481,482,483,484],{"id":389,"depth":352,"text":390},{"id":399,"depth":352,"text":400},{"id":431,"depth":352,"text":432},{"id":452,"depth":352,"text":453},{"id":464,"depth":352,"text":465},"2024-03-15T00:00:00.000Z","Cyberpunk adventure in the neon-lit streets of Neo-Tokyo.","/images/blood-neon/cover/blood-neon-cover.jpg",{},24.99,[491,493],{"title":492,"url":67},"Faction Guide",{"title":494,"url":67},"GM Screen",{"title":24,"description":486},"games/blood-neon",[372,498,499,500],"cyberpunk","adventure","cooperative","E8jPgdvkKTbcxhQK3y4gA7Mat0556b2BUOrr0njLgoY",{"id":503,"title":20,"available":186,"body":504,"coverImage":355,"currency":356,"date":619,"description":620,"extension":359,"featured":186,"image":621,"manualUrl":57,"meta":622,"navigation":186,"path":21,"playTime":355,"playerCount":355,"price":623,"published":186,"releaseDate":355,"resources":624,"seo":630,"slug":508,"stem":631,"tags":632,"thumbnail":355,"__hash__":636},"games/games/era-of-silence.md",{"type":188,"value":505,"toc":611},[506,509,511,517,519,545,547,561,563,566,570,574,587,591,596,601,606],[191,507,20],{"id":508},"era-of-silence",[203,510,390],{"id":389},[195,512,513,514,516],{},"In a world where words can kill, silence is your greatest ally. ",[207,515,20],{}," is a strategic card game for 2-4 players where you must navigate a dystopian society where verbal communication has become deadly.",[203,518,400],{"id":399},[402,520,521,527,533,539],{},[405,522,523,526],{},[210,524,525],{},"Strategic Depth",": Complex mechanics combining resource management, timing, and bluffing",[405,528,529,532],{},[210,530,531],{},"Unique Theme",": Explore a world where the power of speech has been weaponized",[405,534,535,538],{},[210,536,537],{},"Quick Play",": 30-45 minute games perfect for casual and competitive play",[405,540,541,544],{},[210,542,543],{},"Beautiful Art",": Stunning illustrations by renowned fantasy artists",[203,546,432],{"id":431},[402,548,549,552,555,558],{},[405,550,551],{},"120 High-quality cards",[405,553,554],{},"Rulebook with detailed mechanics",[405,556,557],{},"Custom dice set",[405,559,560],{},"Storage box with magnetic closure",[203,562,453],{"id":452},[195,564,565],{},"Available now on our store for $29.99 USD plus shipping.",[195,567,568],{},[342,569,461],{"href":87},[203,571,573],{"id":572},"license-open-gaming","License & Open Gaming",[195,575,576,578,579,582,583,586],{},[207,577,20],{}," is published under the ",[210,580,581],{},"Open Gaming License (OGL)",". The core mechanics are freely available for others to use, modify, and build upon in their own games. Visit ",[342,584,56],{"href":57,"rel":585},[346]," for the complete OGL terms and starter kit materials.",[203,588,590],{"id":589},"reviews","Reviews",[195,592,593],{},[207,594,595],{},"\"Era of Silence captures the tension of a society on the brink perfectly. The mechanics are elegant yet challenging.\"",[402,597,598],{},[405,599,600],{},"Tabletop Gaming Magazine",[195,602,603],{},[207,604,605],{},"\"A must-play for fans of strategic card games with a unique twist.\"",[402,607,608],{},[405,609,610],{},"Board Game Enthusiast",{"title":351,"searchDepth":352,"depth":352,"links":612},[613,614,615,616,617,618],{"id":389,"depth":352,"text":390},{"id":399,"depth":352,"text":400},{"id":431,"depth":352,"text":432},{"id":452,"depth":352,"text":453},{"id":572,"depth":352,"text":573},{"id":589,"depth":352,"text":590},"2024-01-20T00:00:00.000Z","A strategic tabletop game set in a dystopian future where silence is the ultimate weapon.","/images/era-of-silence/cover/era-of-silence-cover.png",{},29.99,[625,628],{"title":626,"url":627},"Quick Reference Guide","/resources/era-of-silence-quick-reference",{"title":629,"url":67},"Character Sheets",{"title":20,"description":620},"games/era-of-silence",[372,633,634,635],"strategy","dystopian","card-game","ckw77tiCC9qc0DCnn5IokyWcVTYV1XronrzpaqDkhpo",{"id":184,"title":185,"available":186,"body":638,"coverImage":355,"currency":356,"date":357,"description":358,"extension":359,"featured":360,"image":361,"manualUrl":53,"meta":762,"navigation":186,"path":363,"playTime":355,"playerCount":355,"price":364,"published":186,"releaseDate":355,"resources":763,"seo":765,"slug":369,"stem":370,"tags